Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(428,428)}{\fad(428,428)}{\blur10}只是静静地等待时间流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur10}今天逐渐化为过去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur10}心里不禁涌起了一丝悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(445,445)}{\blur10}单凭文字已无法填满内心的空虚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur10}渐渐感到痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur10}只能仰望着漫天星光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur10}明天在如此的世界里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur10}我们依旧不得不继续呼吸着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(188,188)}{\blur10}融化于夜色中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.89,0:00:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur10}那如冰块般的寂寞尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur10}真的能寻见所谓的幸福吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.11,0:00:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(285,285)}{\blur10}只要祈求着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur10}总有一天一定能与你相视而笑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.55,0:00:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur10}遥远彼方星辰的闪烁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.39,0:00:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur10}而我们绝不会忘记今天这个日子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:01:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur10}以及那寂静尽头的歌声
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(482,482)}{\blur10}无能为力的我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(379,379)}{\blur10}只能一直等待着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur10}啊啊、我会永远记得
